msgctxt "80"
msgid "You son of a bitch..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "No way... But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu... I'll never forgive you, as long as I live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Arase..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Are you all right!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Ibuki? What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Sorry. I got worried when I couldn't get a hold of you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "So you're the head of the HLA..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Arase-san. It was you all this time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Why, you... How do you know who I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "You bet I know. I've been looking for you this whole time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "For me? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "I knew the family gave you a rough time after your fight with Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "And nobody was as worried about you as Kashiwagi-san was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Kashiwagi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Kashiwagi-san knew you'd been disowned by them and searched all over "
"Kamurocho for you himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"He knew exactly what you were up against. That's why he tried so hard to "
"find you⑬so he could help you in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "You people should've minded your own business..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Stop pretending what you're doing is anything more than hypocrisy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "You're wrong about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "When Kashiwagi-san created the HLA, he faced overwhelming opposition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Many people were against him using family money to help people who'd quit "
"the business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"But despite all that, he pushed the project forward. His intentions were "
"never insincere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Arase, their conviction is the real deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Kashiwagi-san's concern for your welfare was real, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Is revenge really the way you want to respond to all that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "You got no right to preach at me, asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Arase..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"I realize my revenge may seem like repaying kindness with resentment to "
"some..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "But if I don't do something, it'll keep gnawing away at me from inside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Arase-san, it's still not too late. Why don't you start over again with us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Start over? Start what over?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "I've lost everything. It's too late for me to start anything over..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"You organized the hitmen. You've got the kind of charisma others wish they "
"had."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "You can do things nobody else can. You haven't lost your touch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Arase-san. Please come to the HLA with us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Boss..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "I didn't know there were people willing to offer me a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "People like Kashiwagi... and you... You're just hopeless fools..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Maybe so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "There may be some truth to what you're saying..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "But as for you, Kazuma Kiryu... I'll still never forgive you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Ibuki, was it? I won't be causing you any more trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "You have my word. Just stay out of my business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Arase-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "And you, Kazuma Kiryu. I'll settle the score with you later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Let's go, Shinzaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "...Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "You sure about letting him go like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Yes. There's nothing to worry about now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "How can you be so sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "The first thing we do at the HLA is trust people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"When we help somebody, we truly believe he can turn his life around, that "
"he'll stop causing trouble for others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Without trust, we can't get our message across."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "I see. Makes a whole lot of sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"I'm more worried about you. It sounds like they're going to challenge you "
"to another fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "If that happens, I'll be ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "I should've known you'd say something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "How can this be happening...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "You can't beat me. You can see that now, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Why...? Why can't I win...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Because you're fighting for revenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "Nothing good can come of revenge. You just don't realize it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Stop fucking around, you moron!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "Boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu. Remember me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "You were in the Nishikiyama Family, weren't you... Arase?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "I'm honored that a legendary yakuza like you would remember my name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "You're the ringleader of the Reapers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "Bingo. Pleasure to see you again, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "Why are you doing this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "Why, you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "To get rid of you, Kazuma Kiryu! What other reason would there be!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you've forgotten! My life went to hell after you beat the tar "
"out of me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid ""
"You were lucky enough to survive, but after that, the family treated me "
"like shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "Even bottom feeders took the chance to gang up on me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid ""
"And to top it off, they disowned me! Guess they just wanted to get rid of "
"me, huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"Once I was disowned by a family under the Tojo Clan, there was no place I "
"could go in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid ""
"My old comrades looked down on me. They refused to have anything to do with "
"me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "I'll never forgive them! I'm gonna kill every last one of those fuckers!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "Arase..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid "And this is all thanks to you, Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "Yet here you are, trying to screw me over again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid "I'll never forgive you! I'll just have to finish you off myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid "Come on, Shinzaki... Don't screw this up again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "Sure thing, boss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "This is the end of the line..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid "Time to pay with your life, Kazuma Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

